-11T09:45:00Z", "description": "Incident INC-2026-1201 created. Multiple system issues reported: SIEM storage saturation, partner integration blocked, service account locked."}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-11T09:50:00Z", "description": "Debug logging disabled on SIEM cluster to prevent data loss."}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-11T09:52:00Z", "description": "Firewall rule added to allow Acme Corp IP 203.0.113.50."}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-11T09:55:00Z", "description": "Service account 'svc_backup_admin' locked due to log storm; sessions and API keys revoked as precaution."}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-11T10:15:00Z", "description": "Host WS-FIN-042 identified as source of malicious activity and isolated."}]}, "justification": "LLM proposed: T13_dashboard"}
